    "title": "10/8/25: Partly Cloudy Day with a High of 72.7, Cooling to 57.6 Tonight - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Source Staff ,\n5 hours ago Maury County Weather Update: 10/8/25\nAt 6:00 PM in Maury County, the temperature is currently 68.4°F under partly cloudy skies. Winds are mild at 3.7 mph, with no precipitation recorded.\nEarlier today, the area experienced a high of 72.7°F and a low of 57.6°F. Winds reached up to 9.6 mph, though the chance of precipitation remained low at 4%, resulting in no rainfall. Conditions included some fog earlier in the day.\nTonight, temperatures are expected to drop to a low of 57.6°F. The skies will remain partly cloudy, with wind speeds decreasing slightly to a maximum of 5.5 mph. There is no chance of precipitation forecasted for tonight.\nResidents can expect continuing mild weather into the evening with stable conditions.\n7-Day Forecast\nDay High Low Conditions\nWednesday 73°F 58°F Fog\nThursday 70°F 51°F Mainly clear\nFriday 73°F 54°F Overcast\nSaturday 74°F 53°F Overcast\nSunday 78°F 56°F Overcast\nMonday 83°F 60°F Overcast\nTuesday 82°F 63°F Partly cloudy",
